{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear my \u300e\u300f</strong> is the debut title from the three-person development team, <strong>Touch to Start</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a <strong>visual novel</strong> game where you exchange letters and build memories with <i>her</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another ordinary day\u2014until a letter arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sender? A girl who had always been by your side since childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She had once left\u2026 but now, she\u2019s standing before you again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send her your replies, travel to various places, and relive precious memories together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear my \u300e\u300f</strong> delivers quiet comfort and gentle excitement through its emotional story, beautiful backgrounds, and heartfelt letters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 30 minutes of total playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching and heartwarming story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive character animations and facial expressions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls using mouse and keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive letters and build memories by writing heartfelt replies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866180?t=1757246420","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866180?t=1757246420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866180/aabc4f7e4a44fcdb443a44ad51c0707a4737b1a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757246420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866180/aabc4f7e4a44fcdb443a44ad51c0707a4737b1a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757246420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear my \u300e\u300f</strong> is the debut title from the three-person development team, <strong>Touch to Start</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a <strong>visual novel</strong> game where you exchange letters and build memories with <i>her</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another ordinary day\u2014until a letter arrives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sender? A girl who had always been by your side since childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She had once left\u2026 but now, she\u2019s standing before you again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send her your replies, travel to various places, and relive precious memories together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dear my \u300e\u300f</strong> delivers quiet comfort and gentle excitement through its emotional story, beautiful backgrounds, and heartfelt letters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approx. 30 minutes of total playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching and heartwarming story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive character animations and facial expressions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls using mouse and keyboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive letters and build memories by writing heartfelt replies</p></li></ul>","developers":["Touch to Start"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866180/8a0747be83bf1f3c0ae74a0976b15959034c4c1d/header.jpg?t=1757246420","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257167362,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257167362/movie480.mp4?